ands\" width=\"121\" height=\"109\" draggable=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> <h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">30-Day Money-Back Guarantee</h3> <div style=\"text-align: center;\"> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Since we are so confident that you will<strong>&nbsp;absolutely adore</strong></span><strong> your Glistening Glow Garlands</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, we are offering a 30-day money-back guarantee. If you aren’t satisfied for any reason, simply contact us and ask for a full refund.</span></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> </div> </div>",
